      "name": "dsh-calendar-board",
      "title": {
        "en": "Calendar Board",
        "zh": "日历看板"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Month calendar board for DSH: daily tasks, scheduled reminders, this Mac's calendars (macOS, zero setup), Google Calendar OAuth and iCal subscriptions — each source its own color — plus inline editing and a chime + fireworks on completion. Exposes a calendar_board tool so any session can read and edit the board.",
        "zh": "DSH 的月视图日历看板：每日事项、定时任务、本机日历（macOS 零配置）、Google 日历授权与 iCal 订阅，按来源配色；点击日期格直接编辑，勾掉一条有音效与烟花。并暴露 calendar_board 工具，任何会话都能读写看板。"
      },
